sentences.text:
The present writ petition has been filed by the petitioner - Bhagvan Deen Chaudhary with a prayer to issue a writ in the nature of certiorari to quash the impugned FIR bearing FIR No.0028 of 2023,
under Sections 406, 419, 420, 467, 468, 471 I.P.C., Police Station - Ramnagar, District - Barabanki;
with a further prayer not to arrest the petitioner in pursuance of the impugned FIR.

